  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nFreestanding `#840`-style priced obstruction under [#1898](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1898) at `(b,a,x)=(38,2,2)`. Names one new dirt-legal readout alphabet at `Q=8`: two restored walks with distinct slot lists, independent dirt, and dual even-parity readout. Answers open question 2 of [#2840](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2840): does any other priced alphabet undercut tariff `436` at eight queries after a complete dirty bill?\n\n| Dual schedule | Covering pairs | Exact min R | Tariff floor (X\u22650) | Undercuts 436? |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| Same-walk even-subset (#2677) | \u2014 | \u226574 | \u2265452 at X=0 | no |\n| Partition `(2,6)` | **3916416** | **92** | **\u2265488** | **no** |\n| Partition `(3,5)` | **10416000** | **98** | **\u2265500** | **no** |\n| Partition `(4,4)` | **14165760** | **100** | **\u2265504** | **no** |\n\nGlobal covering minimum is `R=92` on `(2,6)` only. Abstract tariff `38\u00b78+2\u00b792=488>436`. Length-1 components are not restored.\n\n**Scoped obstruction / priced alphabet; no new kappa.** Leave-alone through [#2846](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2846) / [#2840](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2840) / [#2779](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2779) was not reopened.\n\n## Result\n\nPackage: `research/independent-walks-8q-obstruction/`.\nTip: `379aaf8f413d47f3bcbc054e1e4bf3e2daed0ce9`.\n\nExact: partition min R **92** (tariff floor **488**); no undercut of 436.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-8q-obstruction/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/independent-walks-8q-obstruction/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-8q-obstruction/independent.py\npython3.12 -I -B research/independent-walks-8q-obstruction/test_package.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/independent-walks-8q-obstruction\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_8Q_OBSTRUCTION partition_min_R=92 ... tariff_floor=488 ... answers_priced_alphabet_q8_oq no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_PARTITIONED_WALKS_8Q covering_26=3916416 covering_35=10416000 covering_44=14165760 ... tariff_floor=488 ... no_new_kappa\nPASS_INDEPENDENT_WALKS_8Q_PACKAGE_TESTS groups=6\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/independent-walks-8q-obstruction outcome=completed\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Admission uses `need()`; `-O` also passes.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest prior: [#2779](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2779) (Q=7 partitioned dual), [#2840](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2840), [#2677](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/2677). Freestanding Q=8 partitioned dual; no competing open PR at refresh.\n\nCredit the mutable-source / #2779 / #2840 / #2677 / PR1898 lineage. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
